0..76 Comment "// What a string\'s view may not do: outlive its access, be ended twice or be"
77..151 Comment "// left unended. A view lives for its access, so these are refused with no"
152..228 Comment "// annotation saying how long it lives. A view kept in the region of a scope"
229..307 Comment "// around it lives as long as that scope, and no longer: it does not leave the"
308..384 Comment "// region, and the string it views is not written while the region keeps it."
386..415 Comment "// The lists; the byte lists."
